<title>UK: LIFFE Christmas and New Year trading timetable.</title>
<headline>LIFFE Christmas and New Year trading timetable.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London International Financial Futures and Options Exchange (LIFFE) said its trading schedule for the Christmas 1996 and New Year 1997 period was as follows:</p>
<p>DEC 24: Floor closed by 1232 GMT. No APT</p>
<p>DEC 25: CLOSED</p>
<p>DEC 26: CLOSED</p>
<p>DEC 27: Floor closed by 1232 GMT. No APT</p>
<p>DEC 30: Normal sessions</p>
<p>DEC 31: Floor closed by 1232 GMT. No APT</p>
<p>JAN 1:  CLOSED</p>
<p>JAN 2:  Normal sessions</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
</text>
